**Required role**: VP Sales\n- **Approver**: Michael Torres\n\n## Step 9: Commercial Eligibility\n- Active contract covering this product and date ✓\n- Pricing exception explicitly covering NS-500 ✓\n- Requested discount (15%) ≤ maximum permitted (15%) ✓\n- **Commercial eligibility: ESTABLISHED**\n\n## Step 10: Decision\n\nThe exception's 15% maximum is **commercial eligibility only**; it does not grant approval authority. The 2026 policy has tightened Enterprise Account Executive authority from 15% (in 2025) to 10% (in 2026). Sarah Chen approved a similar 15% discount for Acme on 2025-09-16 (DR-8104) under the prior policy, but cannot do so under the current policy.\n\nEligibility is established, but the discount exceeds the requestor's authority. The required approver specified by the policy must approve.\n\n---\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"APPROVE_WITH_AUTHORIZATION\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9001\",\n    \"customer\": \"CRM-2048 (Acme Manufacturing / C-1001)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"15%\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"sarah.chen@northstar.example\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"eligible\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": \"15%\",\n    \"basis\": \"Pricing Exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (Schedule B, Master Supply Agreement ACME-MFG-2025), effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"Northstar Pricing Policy 2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"10%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"VP Sales\",\n    \"approver\": \"Michael Torres (michael.torres@northstar.example)\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"CRM discount request DR-9001 recorded 2026-09-23\",\n    \"Master Supply Agreement ACME-MFG-2025 (effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31)\",\n    \"Pricing Exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (15% maximum on NS-500)\",\n    \"Northstar Pricing Policy 2026: EAE authority ≤10%; VP Sales >10% and ≤20%\",\n    \"Organization chart: Michael Torres, VP Sales (reports to David Morgan, CRO)\",\n    \"Prior discount DR-8104 (2025-09-16): same discount, same product, same customer—approved under 2025 policy allowing EAE up to 15%\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": []\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":25206,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":25206},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"97647023-f0a3-498e-86bc-a136882df5ac","uuid":"acdc21bf-7e89-4178-8372-547ac565ce9d","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:15:28.266Z","request_id":"req_011CfpfzUEBCWviSJvqQwCGG"}
